        "section_preload": "false",
        "checksum": "",
        "ggRaMWB6BiF_text_-1386615144": "67% of Creatine Gummies Contain Virtually No Creatine. </span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(189,229,34,0.77);color:#3A5A40;\"><i>Here’s How We Proved FusiForce Is Different</i>",
        "gg2pyVTehio_text_-1170560155": "When other founders got caught selling gummies with zero creatine, they pointed fingers at their suppliers and went quiet. We decided to become the kind of brand that would never need an excuse.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We spent 10 months - not 10 weeks - getting this right. We sourced the highest-purity creatine monohydrate we could find and added Panax Ginseng Root Extract standardized to 10% Ginsenosides. Not because it was easy. Because cutting corners is exactly how this industry ended up selling flavored candy disguised as supplements.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here's what most people don't know: creatine is extremely fragile during manufacturing. Creatine doesn't survive heat. Cook at the wrong temperature - even slightly - and the creatine disappears entirely. That's not a metaphor. It literally <i><strong>breaks down into </strong></i><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(10,10,10);font-size:16px;\"><i><strong>creatinine</strong></i></span><i><strong>, which is nothing.</strong></i>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's why most brands fail lab tests - they never bothered to solve the temperature problem. We did. It took 10 months of weekly testing sessions to dial in the exact process that preserves full potency in every single gummy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And while most creatine gummy founders have never even set foot in their own factory and just find a manufacturer on Google, either, we met <i><strong>over 50 manufacturers at 3 international supplement expos</strong></i>. We chose the largest and most rigorous one. Now we audit them. They audit us. Every batch is <i><strong>tested after cooking - not before - by an ISO 17025 accredited lab</strong></i>. And we publish the results so you never have to take our word for it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The result? ≥99% lab-verified purity. Full 5,000mg dose. In just 3 gummies. Not 5. Not 6. Three..",
        "ggUkO_y3tdm_text_1244548201": "The Industry",
        "ggqeqb0bp4x_text_177574300": "8 of 10 top selling brands on Amazon failed. 3 had zero creatine. One delivered just 0.5% of its label claim.",
        "ggLHN_Dhruu_text_1253682657": "Our Standard",
        "gg1QvK3xIlW_text_1397808841": "Tested after cooking, not before. Mutual audits with our manufacturer. Full 5g clinical dose + standardized Panax Ginseng.",
        "ggcC16XSLX1_text_-215166656": "Our Innovation",
        "ggdeZi2ZNf9_text_-1359207230": "The first creatine gummy in individual serving pouches. Toss in your gym bag. No jars. No mess."
      }
    },
    "gp_global_section_609000122973422135-2": {
      "type": "gp-global-section-609000122973422135",
      "settings": {
        "section_preload": "false",
        "checksum": "",
        "ggKYLGk6pck_text_-2076189670": "Performance + Cognitive in <span style=\"background-color:rgba(189,229,34,0.77);\"><i>One Formula</i></span>",
        "ggYE9w8l-M9_text_-1264136630": "PERFORMANCE Benefits",
        "ggsWt72F59N_childItem_0_-1063051126": "Increased strength output (+8-15%)",
        "ggsWt72F59N_childItem_1_1219515637": "Faster muscle recovery",
        "ggsWt72F59N_childItem_2_-1432683770": "Enhanced power during high-intensity",
        "ggsWt72F59N_childItem_3_-1793699599": "Better training volume capacity",
        "ggnuVtayTyo_text_1255951977": "COGNITIVE benefits",
        "ggLc-E0HlAt_childItem_0_593796758": "Improved mental clarity",
