        "ggCw1HmiHT1_label": "<p>Reviews</p>",
        "ggV-QyfZcGm_label": "<p>FAQ</p>",
        "gg2G19ioep8_label": "<p>Get started</p>",
        "gglVKaS36l4_text": "<p>\"Night shift worker here. These gummies gave me way better recovery and I’m actually building muscle again. Lab reports proved the full 5g dose, and the portable pouches are perfect for my gym bag. Coworkers keep asking why I look so awake.\"</p>",
        "gganh9tW-cV_text": "<p><strong>Nate, 42, Las Vegas </strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "ggiK3vS-wCe_text": "<p>\"My husband and I both take these now. We’re stronger, recover faster, and having more fun in the gym. The portable pouches make it super easy. We call them our ‘happy couple candy’ — best habit this year.\"</p>",
        "ggpSep9U299_text": "<p><strong>Sophia, 38, Denver &nbsp;</strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "ggu1Ukz6HpI_text": "<p>\"At 51 I thought creatine was for kids. These gummies proved me wrong. I’m moving weights I haven’t touched in years and recovering faster. My doctor asked what I’m doing different. I told him 'magic green apple candy'. He wrote it down.\"</p>",
        "ggu1CyJSdka_text": "<p><strong>Derek, 51, Tampa </strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "ggLFZkkt-zo_text": "<p>\"I hit a plateau after 12 years training. These gummies broke it hard. I’m adding weight every week and my workouts feel strong again. My gym buddy is pissed because I’m progressing faster than him. I just tell him to get on the gummies.\"</p>",
        "ggWHRkCRKlS_text": "<p><strong>Ryan, 34, Boston </strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "ggoXD5Ur96p_text": "<p>137,235+ Customers • 4.9/5 Rating • 🔬 2 Third-Party Lab Reports</p>",
        "ggGMi64xDG-_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:px;\">⏳</span></p>",
        "ggrGFxFBr7D_text": "<p>Batch: 847 of 20,000 pouches remaining</p>",
        "gg8SWNySLaN_text": "The Creatine Gummy You Can <span style=\"color:#3A5A40;\">Actually Verify - Lab Reports Published. Nothing Hidden</span>",
        "ggP3e6WTYe5_text": "<p>\"Night shift worker here. These gummies gave me way better recovery and I’m actually building muscle again. Lab reports proved the full 5g dose, and the portable pouches are perfect for my gym bag. Coworkers keep asking why I look so awake.\"</p>",
        "ggjFA3OqALd_text": "<p><strong>Nate, 42, Las Vegas </strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "ggfoUDmgwuE_text": "<p>\"My husband and I both take these now. We’re both stronger, recovering faster, and honestly having more fun in the gym together. We call them our 'happy couple candy' because we both feel younger and more alive. Best habit we started this year.\"</p>",
        "gga10yNSr85_text": "<p><strong>Sophia, 38, Denver &nbsp;</strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "ggiQD9_ZBpY_text": "<p>\"At 51 I thought creatine was for kids. These gummies proved me wrong. I’m moving weights I haven’t touched in years and recovering faster. My doctor asked what I’m doing different. I told him 'magic green apple candy'. He wrote it down.\"</p>",
        "ggUO8wb66om_text": "<p><strong>Derek, 51, Tampa </strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "gg8TLhLgH9P_text": "<p>\"I hit a plateau after 12 years training. These gummies broke it hard. I’m adding weight every week and my workouts feel strong again. My gym buddy is pissed because I’m progressing faster than him. I just tell him to get on the gummies.\"</p>",
        "ggyPbg3e6Xp_text": "<p><strong>Ryan, 34, Boston </strong>- <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Verified Customer</span></p>",
        "ggfbLtv_BgV_text": "<p>FusiForce™ Creatine Monohydrate Gummies | 5,000mg Per Serving | 25mg Standardized Panax Ginseng Extract.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Built by a founder who spent 10 months obsessing over every detail and is willing to take full accountability. Tested after cooking. Lab reports published. Nothing hidden.</p>",
        "ggSCdHpjgvL_childItem_0": "<p><strong>+15–20% strength &amp; faster recovery</strong> - full clinical 5g dose that actually works</p>",
        "ggSCdHpjgvL_childItem_1": "<p><strong>Lab-verified after cooking</strong> - not before (unlike 8 of the top 10 Amazon brands that failed)</p>",
        "ggSCdHpjgvL_childItem_2": "<p><strong>Portable single-serve pouches</strong> - the first gummy brand designed for gym rats (no melting, no sticky mess, toss in your bag)</p>",
        "ggSCdHpjgvL_childItem_3": "<p><strong>Add Panax Ginseng Root Extract (Standardized to 10% Ginsenosides)</strong> + obsessive weekly testing on flavor, shape &amp; temperature for 10 months</p>",
        "ggVmUN-U4B0_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:px;\">Delivered on</span></p>",
        "ggYJUHqfzBY_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:px;\">with Express Shipping</span></p>",
